{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type CollectionStatus = \"idle\" | \"loading\" | \"ready\" | \"error\" | \"cleaned-up\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L699","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/types.ts:699"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Collection status values for lifecycle management"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Check collection status\nif (collection.status === \"loading\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is loading initial data\")\n} else if (collection.status === \"ready\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is ready for use\")\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"code","value":"// Status transitions\n// idle → loading → ready (when markReady() is called)\n// Any active status can transition to → error or cleaned-up\n// error → ready after a successful sync recovery","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype CollectionStatus = \"idle\" | \"loading\" | \"ready\" | \"error\" | \"cleaned-up\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:699](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L699)\n\nCollection status values for lifecycle management\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n// Check collection status\nif (collection.status === \"loading\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is loading initial data\")\n} else if (collection.status === \"ready\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is ready for use\")\n}\n```\n\n```ts\n// Status transitions\n// idle → loading → ready (when markReady() is called)\n// Any active status can transition to → error or cleaned-up\n// error → ready after a successful sync recovery\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CollectionStatus\ntitle: CollectionStatus\n---\n\n```ts\ntype CollectionStatus = \"idle\" | \"loading\" | \"ready\" | \"error\" | \"cleaned-up\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:699](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L699)\n\nCollection status values for lifecycle management\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n// Check collection status\nif (collection.status === \"loading\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is loading initial data\")\n} else if (collection.status === \"ready\") {\n  console.log(\"Collection is ready for use\")\n}\n```\n\n```ts\n// Status transitions\n// idle → loading → ready (when markReady() is called)\n// Any active status can transition to → error or cleaned-up\n// error → ready after a successful sync recovery\n```\n"}
